  "ingredients": [
    "3 eggs",
    "2.5 cups white sugar",
    "1.125 cups vegetable oil",
    "1.5 cups milk",
    "1.5 teaspoons salt",
    "1.5 teaspoons baking powder",
    "1.5 tablespoons poppy seeds",
    "1.5 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "1.5 teaspoons almond extract",
    "3 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 cup orange juice",
    "0.5 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.5 teaspoon almond extract",
    "2 teaspoons butter, melted"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 12-cup muffin pan or line cups with paper liners.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MV9_2gGjT_-BR03MUrjTYJ50lp4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-6869-poppy-seed-muffins-VAT-step-01-9bbf550480544c67becba8b616d410f7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6869/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat eggs, 2 ½ cups white sugar, and vegetable oil together in a bowl until well blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/weaXjOwtZM7WuxEhZ5wRzrZw5hE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-6869-poppy-seed-muffins-VAT-step-02-2-e43638b6366d41feb660b5980fd956d4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6869/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add milk, salt, baking powder, poppy seeds, vanilla, almond extract, and flour; mix well until just combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/177d7jFaBIR7CGtZvjXa9F9g8yU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-6869-poppy-seed-muffins-VAT-step-03-2-028fbc4b87e94e2892484d48e7db9298.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6869/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon batter into the prepared muffin cups, filling each 3/4 full.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AVk1m97mNogQ5Vyykg0jsTHh9XE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-6869-poppy-seed-muffins-VAT-step-04-71ae38af420c43d48021715cfeed46b7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6869/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until tops spring back when lightly pressed, about 15 to 20 minutes. Cool muffins in the pan for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mNVjcKELi3EpaunupFjncMSjRR4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-6869-poppy-seed-muffins-VAT-step-05-d041a4b70df349dcaafa166d417024d5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6869/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make the glaze: Combine 3/4 cup sugar, orange juice, 1/2 teaspoon vanilla, 1/2 teaspoon almond flavoring, and 2 teaspoons melted butter in a saucepan over low heat; heat and stir over medium-low heat until smooth and sugar is dissolved.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KbihZDt1rt7SeE-IOK-9KBEFBvQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-6869-poppy-seed-muffins-VAT-step-06-2-d3489787d4d94db6a63e5fb505479064.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6869/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dunk muffin tops into glaze; place on a cooling rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G5JLRUXH6CDgZRskZVOmtzMb5xY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-6869-poppy-seed-muffins-VAT-step-07-1d4b6c91bcdf4cc7a9a31c20494f0531.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6869/step_07.webp"
